flowchart TD
  A[Valid claim submitted] --> B[Compute local baseline first]
  B --> C[Read key from localStorage or Vite env]
  C --> D{Key available?}
  D -->|No| E[Skip Gemini and return baseline]
  D -->|Yes| F[Select claim fields and baseline flags]
  F --> G[Build examiner prompt and JSON schema]
  G --> H[GoogleGenAI generateContent]
  H --> I{Request succeeds?}
  I -->|No| J[Catch warning and return null]
  I -->|Yes| K[Parse response.text as JSON]
  K --> L{Summary and fraud pattern present?}
  L -->|No| M[Return null]
  L -->|Yes| N[Attach optional Gemini analysis]
  J --> O[Show baseline result]
  M --> O
  E --> O
  N --> P[Show baseline plus AI narrative]
  O --> Q[Heuristic tier and score stay unchanged]
  P --> Q
